{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Attention Mechanism.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Attention Mechanism.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"attention mechanism attention mechanism","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Attention Mechanism.md","fileName":"Attention Mechanism.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Attention Mechanism","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 16:28\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Machine Learning and Neural Networks]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Machine Learning and Neural Networks","Encoder-Decoder Network","aiassistants.epub","deeplearning_mit.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Attention Mechanism.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Attention Mechanism.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"attention mechanism attention mechanism","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Attention Mechanism.md","fileName":"Attention Mechanism.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Attention Mechanism","heading":"Attention Mechanism","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"An attention mechanism lets a neural model assign different importance to different parts of its input while producing an output. Instead of forcing all information through one fixed summary, it builds a context weighted toward what is currently relevant.\n\nIn an [[Encoder-Decoder Network]], attention helps align an output word or symbol with the input positions that support it. The weights are learned with the rest of the network.\n\nKelleher presents attention-centered transformer models as an alternative to relying on one fixed sentence vector: the model can dynamically focus on selected input parts while generating an output. He also describes BERT's use of an unlabeled-data pretraining stage followed by smaller task-specific supervised tuning. These were developments discussed in the book's 2019 outlook, not a claim about which architecture currently leads every task.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Machine Learning and Neural Networks","Encoder-Decoder Network","aiassistants.epub","deeplearning_mit.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Attention Mechanism.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Attention Mechanism.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"attention mechanism attention mechanism","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Attention Mechanism.md","fileName":"Attention Mechanism.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Attention Mechanism","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[aiassistants.epub]]\n\n[[deeplearning_mit.epub]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Machine Learning and Neural Networks","Encoder-Decoder Network","aiassistants.epub","deeplearning_mit.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}